{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.IrreducibleCubicNoQuadraticRoot","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.IrreducibleCubicNoQuadraticRoot","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.FieldTheory.Minpoly.Field","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.IrreducibleCubicNoQuadraticRoot.not_isRoot_of_irreducible_cubic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.IrreducibleCubicNoQuadraticRoot.not_isRoot_of_irreducible_cubic","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IrreducibleCubicNoQuadraticRoot.lean#L86-L96","doc":"**Contrapositive, in the shape the prune uses.** No element annihilated by a\nnonzero quadratic is a root of the irreducible cubic — so the sheets of an\nirreducible cubic curve are not elements of a quadratic extension of the base\nrational function field. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.IrreducibleCubicNoQuadraticRoot.no_root_of_irreducible_cubic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.IrreducibleCubicNoQuadraticRoot.no_root_of_irreducible_cubic","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IrreducibleCubicNoQuadraticRoot.lean#L67-L84","doc":"**An irreducible cubic has no root of degree at most two.** If `a` is annihilated\nby a nonzero polynomial of degree `≤ 2` over `F` — which is what membership of a\nquadratic extension of `F` supplies — then `a` is not a root of an irreducible cubic\nover `F`.\n\nThis is the step that carries the #6695 exclusion from the base coordinate `z` to the\nlocal coordinate `t` at a ramification point, where `K(t) / K(z)` is quadratic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.IrreducibleCubicNoQuadraticRoot.degree_minpoly_eq_of_irreducible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.IrreducibleCubicNoQuadraticRoot.degree_minpoly_eq_of_irreducible","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IrreducibleCubicNoQuadraticRoot.lean#L61-L65","doc":"**The minimal polynomial of a root of an irreducible `p` has `p`'s degree.** ","signatureChunk":0}]}